  "description": "What's hidden behind that mosaic?\n\n\"I can kind of see the shape, but... what is it?\"\n\"Oh, I know! ...Wait, maybe not?\"\nA speed quiz that puts your eyes and instincts to the test.\n\nIn this game, you look at a mosaic-covered image and race to pick the correct answer from four choices.\n\nAnimals, food, instruments, vehicles, flowers...\nWith 300 questions covering everything from everyday objects to surprising subjects, there's always something new to guess.\n\nHow to play is simple.\n・Look at the mosaic image\n・Choose your answer from 4 options\n・The original image is revealed with the answer!\n\nThe thrill of \"Wait, THAT's what it was?!\" and the satisfaction of \"I knew it!\" will keep you coming back for more.\n\nThree levels of mosaic intensity await you.\nEarly stages start with a light mosaic where shapes are visible, building up to an almost impossible heavy mosaic in later stages.\nHow far can you see through?\n\nPlay from just one question at a time.\nPerfect for filling a few spare minutes.\n\nCan you see what's beyond the mosaic?\n\nThe game supports both button controls and touch controls, allowing you to play in TV mode, handheld mode, or tabletop mode.\n※This game is designed to be played on the Nintendo Switch™ in vertical orientation.\n",
